          "filename": "Criccieth - Berea.JPG",
          "caption": "Criccieth - Berea In 1841 the Scotch Baptist congregation at Capel Uchaf in Criccieth broke away to become Particular Baptists, followers of Alexander Campbell and the Disciples of Christ. 1886 saw them move to their new home at Berea on Tan-y-Grisiau Terrace, and in 1939 they joined the mainstream Baptists.",
